COMMENT ON TABLE public.schedule_patterns IS 'Recurring shift patterns: a repeating cycle of local clock-time slots in a named time zone with an optional booking target, generated horizon_days ahead. Assignments apply a pattern to a person on a people board; editing a pattern changes only future generation.';


